{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17854","headline":"青云干吕 · 令狐楚","name":"青云干吕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郁郁复纷纷，青霄干吕云。\n色令天下见，候向管中分。\n远覆无人境，遥彰有德君。\n瑞容惊不散，冥感信稀闻。\n湛露羞依草，南风耻带薰。\n恭惟汉武帝，余烈尚氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}